### WD-5136 — Optimization/optimizeOrders
# Rutas de entrega de órdenes y acomodo 3D de la carga en cada unidad (cada entrega se
# descarga por la puerta sin mover las siguientes; se respetan apilable, frágil, este lado
# arriba y solo piso). Las órdenes necesitan bultos y las unidades caja de carga en su
# vehículo. No guarda ni despacha: para despachar, una llamada a UnitWorkplan/bulkData por
# ruta (ver el último caso).
# Ids de Desarrollo, organización 229: órdenes con bultos 20875-20880 (en San Salvador,
# ~225 km de la bodega); unidades con caja 2361 y 2362, sin caja 2363; Bodega Central 4202.
# Errores: 400 = 1011, 500 = 1004.

### 1) Terminan en la última entrega (sin regreso)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875, 20876, 20877, 20878, 20879, 20880],
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationMode": "lastStop",
  "departureTime": "06:00",
  "shiftHours": 12
}

### 2) Terminan en otra referencia (destinationMode = location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875, 20876, 20877, 20878, 20879, 20880],
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationMode": "location",
  "destinationLocationId": 4202,
  "departureTime": "00:00",
  "shiftHours": 24
}

### 3) Menos espacio usable (30 %): lo que no cabe vuelve en unassigned con tooBig
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875, 20876, 20877, 20878, 20879, 20880],
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationMode": "lastStop",
  "departureTime": "06:00",
  "shiftHours": 12,
  "usableRatio": 0.3
}

### 4) Objetivo, descanso y regreso al origen (jornada larga: San Salvador queda lejos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875, 20876, 20877, 20878, 20879, 20880],
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "departureTime": "00:00",
  "shiftHours": 24,
  "objective": "balancear",
  "restAfterHours": 4,
  "restDurationMinutes": 30
}

### 5) 400: regreso al origen en 10 h, ida y vuelta no cabe en la jornada
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875, 20876, 20877, 20878, 20879, 20880],
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362],
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "departureTime": "07:00",
  "shiftHours": 10
}

### 6) 400: unidad sin caja de carga
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875],
  "unitIds": [2363],
  "originLocationId": 4202
}

### 7) 400: orden sin bultos o fuera de la organización
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [1],
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "originLocationId": 4202
}

### 8) 400: destinationMode = location sin destinationLocationId
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderIds": [20875],
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationMode": "location"
}

### 9) Despachar una ruta del caso 1: un UnitWorkplan/bulkData por ruta, con sus paradas
# en orden (locationId de cada parada y sus orderIds como orders). Reemplazar los valores
# con los de la respuesta; estimatedTotalDistance = distanceKm * 1000.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 2361,
  "workplanName": "WD-5136 despacho de optimizeOrders",
  "startDate": "2026-11-06T06:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-06T18:00:00",
  "estimatedTotalDistance": 236140,
  "locations": [
    { "locationId": 13701, "orders": [{ "orderId": 20875 }] },
    { "locationId": 13717, "orders": [{ "orderId": 20876 }] }
  ]
}
